    "n": 13,
    "src": "Pichai",
    "url": "https://x.com/sundarpichai/status/2095184464800526655",
    "text": "Lo restringen a “defensores de confianza”. Porque la misma capacidad, en otras manos, es un arma.\n\nOfensa y defensa, las dos a velocidad de modelo.",
    "image": "/workspace/x-posts/img/13.png",
    "image_downloads": "/home/box/Downloads/x-posts/13.png",
    "status": "posted",
    "posted_url": "https://x.com/andres_lowener/status/2095605180985221360",
