    "n": 6,
    "src": "Diamandis",
    "url": "https://x.com/peterdiamandis/status/2095169837777469701",
    "text": "Un cargo no es una cosa. Es un paquete de tareas.\n\nLa IA redacta, resume, analiza. No negocia, no arma confianza, no decide con incertidumbre.",
    "image": "/workspace/x-posts/img/06.png",
    "image_downloads": "/home/box/Downloads/x-posts/06.png",
    "status": "posted",
    "posted_url": "https://x.com/andres_lowener/status/2095906640801202202",
